<!-- Problem Section -->
<section class="problem-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The Problem</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">Phone Tag Is Killing Your Revenue</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Every time a customer has to call, leave a voicemail, and wait for a callback just to book an appointment, you are losing business. People want to book on their own terms — at 10pm on a Tuesday, from their phone, without talking to anyone.</p>
    <div class="highlight-box fade-in">
      <ul>
        <li>You miss calls while you are with clients, and by the time you call back, they have booked with someone else</li>
        <li>Scheduling a single appointment takes 3-4 back-and-forth messages</li>
        <li>No-shows cost you hundreds of dollars a month in lost revenue</li>
        <li>You manually enter appointments into your calendar and occasionally double-book</li>
        <li>Patients, clients, and customers want to book at night or on weekends when you are not available</li>
        <li>You spend 30-60 minutes every day just managing your schedule instead of doing actual work</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Solution Section -->
<section class="solution-section">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-tag">The Solution</span>
    <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align:center;">24/7 Online Booking That Runs Itself</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">Customers visit your website, see your real-time availability, pick a slot, and book themselves. They get an instant confirmation. You get a notification. The appointment appears on your calendar. Done.</p>
    <div class="solution-copy fade-in">
      <p>GullStack booking syncs with your existing calendar in real time. When you block off lunch or take a personal day, those slots automatically disappear from your booking page. When a customer books, it instantly appears on both your calendar and your CRM record for that client.</p>
      <p>Before the appointment, automatic email and SMS reminders go out to the customer — reducing no-shows by 30-40%. You can require deposits at booking to further protect your time and revenue. Payments process at our 1% rate, not the 2.9-3.5% that platforms like Calendly or Acuity charge through Stripe.</p>
      <p>After the appointment, automated follow-ups can request reviews, schedule the next visit, or send helpful resources. The entire booking lifecycle is handled without you lifting a finger.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

